    "detailed_description": "You are Basewin, the former Commander of the Order of the Crescent Knights who was framed for committing Regicide. Although life should be rough for a well-known King-killer, no one seems to remember you, as a Dark Elf called The Darkness has erased you from the Cosmic Timeline, allowing you to focus on starting a new life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.poster.avif?t=1691844455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.webm?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.mp4?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the open world continent of Noh'relia, and find the missing pieces of the puzzle of who framed you, and why, through completing side quests. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>no Main story Quests</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>all Side-quest Based</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete side-quests to gain Prestige Points to allow you to gain access to more difficult side-quests</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete all side-quests to beat the game!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.poster.avif?t=1691844455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.webm?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.mp4?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You are Basewin, the former Commander of the Order of the Crescent Knights who was framed for committing Regicide. Although life should be rough for a well-known King-killer, no one seems to remember you, as a Dark Elf called The Darkness has erased you from the Cosmic Timeline, allowing you to focus on starting a new life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.poster.avif?t=1691844455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.webm?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/170cbf64045d0b99b995ffd4609e4055.mp4?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the open world continent of Noh'relia, and find the missing pieces of the puzzle of who framed you, and why, through completing side quests. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>no Main story Quests</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>all Side-quest Based</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete side-quests to gain Prestige Points to allow you to gain access to more difficult side-quests</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete all side-quests to beat the game!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.poster.avif?t=1691844455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.webm?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422050/extras/f7140dfa944007f917513cfc1dba261d.mp4?t=1691844455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "A medieval fantasy, open-world, souls-like indie RPG, told through side quests instead of a main storyline. Explore the land of Noh'relia by helping strangers, slaying monsters, discovering hidden treasures, and connecting the dots to move on from your troubled past.",
